DESCRIPTION:Halki's Dormition is a two-part affair: liturgy on the 15th at the restored church of Panagia Choriatis up in the old village of Chorio\, and on the evening of the 14th and 15th a glendi with Dodecanese musicians on the Nimborio harbour front. Everything is a five-minute walk in Nimborio\; the Chorio church is a 3 km walk or taxi ride uphill.\n\nhttps://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/halki/#nimborio-panigiri-of-panagia-nimborio-panagia-choriatis
